    "description": "When you take this Talent, choose one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a> that you know. Once per turn as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can grant the use of this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a> to one ally within 12 squares of you who is <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> Skill.<br><br>The target gains the benefit of this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Secret\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Secret\">Force Secret</a> until the end of your next turn.",
